flowchart TD
    Start([Car arrives at Gate X — Approach A Voice]) --> LPR[LPR reads plate]
    LPR --> MW[Middleware receives plate read]
    MW --> SAP{SAP lookup}

    SAP -->|Found| Kiosk[Push profile to kiosk avatar]
    SAP -->|Not found| Closed1[Show not recognized on avatar]
    Closed1 --> Msg1[Approach A: gate stays closed until staff]

    Kiosk --> Confirm{Driver confirms on-file phone?}
    Confirm -->|Yes| Open1[Open gate]
    Confirm -->|No| Owner{Is driver the owner?}

    Owner -->|Yes| Speak[Driver speaks visit phone]
    Owner -->|No| Staff[Staff escalation after retries]

    Speak --> STT[STT + NLU extract digits]
    STT --> ReadBack[Avatar reads back phone]
    ReadBack --> PhoneOK{Driver confirms digits?}
    PhoneOK -->|Yes| Open2[Open gate]
    PhoneOK -->|No| Speak

    Open1 --> Enqueue[Enqueue visit in shared FIFO queue]
    Open2 --> Enqueue

    Enqueue --> Wait([Driver waits for garage slot])

    Wait --> SlotFree[Slot availability reports slot free]
    SlotFree --> Notify[Notify next queue entry via WhatsApp + SMS + App]
    Notify --> Timer[Start 50s claim timer]

    Timer --> Claim{WhatsApp confirm in time?}
    Claim -->|Yes| Assign[Assign slot — pop from queue]
    Claim -->|No| Shift[Shift entry back N positions]
    Shift --> Notify

    Assign --> Done([Visit complete for this slot cycle])
